    backgroundMusic: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    triggersLyricsGame: 0
    isEnding: 0
    isEndOfBranch: 0
  - speakerName: 
    dialogueText: "Despite everything\u2026 I\u2019m actually proud of myself for
      making it through that challenge. Even if my evaluation was bad.\r\nI can\u2019t
      wait to see what tomorrow brings.\r\nBut first\u2026 I need food. I\u2019m
      starving.\r\n "
